            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI am afraid this is a known and [documented](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/a59a9b7fb0a42cbcf022938ee5f0724320b66f63/doc/mini-snippets.txt#L672-L675) limitation of how tabstop navigation is implemented. The only suggestion is to not use `<C-n>` and `<C-p>` as 'mini.snippets' navigation mappings.",
